# No web env vars are required.
#
# Live Tracking (/tracking) uses the Mappls (MapmyIndia) map when this key is
# set — a static key / access token from https://auth.mappls.com/console,
# ideally restricted to this site's domain (see src/lib/loadMappls.ts).
# VITE_MAPPLS_KEY=your-mappls-key
#
# Without a Mappls key (or if its SDK fails to load) Live Tracking falls back to
# Leaflet + OpenStreetMap tiles, which need no API key. OSM's public tile server
# is meant for light use — for heavy production traffic, point this at a tile
# provider (Stadia, MapTiler, self-hosted, ...). Optional; must be a Leaflet URL
# template.
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tiles.example.com/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
#
# The public customer tracking page (/track/:code) uses VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_JS_KEY
# if set (see src/lib/loadGoogleMaps.ts); without it, it shows no map.
